WEBVTT

00:04.710 --> 00:07.900
But... Adagaki Aki didn't remember it.

00:08.900 --> 00:10.840
So then...

00:12.120 --> 00:14.760
Why do you call me Pig's Foot?

00:15.740 --> 00:17.820
Of course, I don't have any proof.

00:17.820 --> 00:20.840
The Cruel Princess could just be playing dumb.

00:21.960 --> 00:25.800
But I want to hear it 
from you personally, Master.

00:27.320 --> 00:28.750
No.

00:28.750 --> 00:32.320
Right. I mean, all this time...

00:41.960 --> 00:43.860
We were in this together.

00:48.710 --> 00:51.560
You're such an idiot, Pig's Foot.

00:52.370 --> 00:54.900
I'd never do that.

00:54.900 --> 00:56.740
O-Of course not.

00:58.660 --> 00:59.950
I'm lying.

00:59.950 --> 01:00.990
Huh?

01:05.430 --> 01:06.340
Huh?

02:37.090 --> 02:43.050
<b>#4 "I'm Not Going to Fall in Love with You, Pig's Foot"</b>

02:45.350 --> 02:49.370
Aki-chan, where should we go? 
Is there anywhere you want to go?

02:50.010 --> 02:53.150
You can't expect me to decide so suddenly.

02:53.150 --> 02:57.240
O-Of course. Just take 
your time and think about it.

02:59.110 --> 03:01.820
Let you spend time with Aki-sama alone?!

03:01.820 --> 03:05.700
Yes. I have something very 
important to tell her.

03:06.030 --> 03:11.070
You'd better not be trying to do 
something sleazy to Aki-sama!

03:11.070 --> 03:13.400
Of course not.

03:13.400 --> 03:18.840
I mean, I just said I'd wait until 
she sorted out her feelings.

03:18.840 --> 03:23.340
Then why did you say out of the blue
that you wanted to be alone with her?

03:23.340 --> 03:26.720
Aki-sama clearly seems depressed.

03:26.720 --> 03:31.980
Are you sure you're not using this 
as an excuse to get closer to her?

03:33.360 --> 03:34.730
It's the opposite!

03:36.980 --> 03:39.910
It's because Aki-chan's in that state that

03:40.960 --> 03:44.490
I'm going to try to separate her 
from Makabe Masamune for good.

03:44.490 --> 03:46.550
B-But how?

03:47.230 --> 03:52.830
I know! We have that picture of 
Koiwai Yoshino and Makabe Masamune.

03:52.830 --> 03:54.890
Let's start spreading rumors of things

03:54.890 --> 03:58.510
that may or may not have 
happened and ruin his image!

04:00.870 --> 04:04.720
I considered that, too, 
but that's the last resort.

04:04.720 --> 04:06.510
Why, though?!

04:06.510 --> 04:09.390
Even if she found out about 
Makabe and Koiwai Yoshino,

04:09.390 --> 04:13.690
Aki-chan's relationship with Koiwai Yoshino 
wouldn't be the worst it can be.

04:14.050 --> 04:19.150
But if we try to make it worse, 
Aki-chan's the one who'll be hurt.

04:20.530 --> 04:25.470
True. If Aki-sama and Koiwai Yoshino's 
relationship were to completely fall apart,

04:25.470 --> 04:28.960
it'd prove difficult to get Aki-sama 
back on her feet, even for us.

04:28.960 --> 04:31.160
Though I hate to admit that...

04:31.520 --> 04:34.240
Aki-chan isn't the one we're 
supposed to be attacking.

04:34.240 --> 04:35.420
Makabe is.

04:36.100 --> 04:40.890
Not to mention, even if we deliberately 
try to separate Makabe from Aki-chan,

04:40.890 --> 04:45.430
our hard work will be wasted 
if Koiwai Yoshino gets in the way.

04:47.200 --> 04:51.980
That's why our first priority is to make sure 
Koiwai Yoshino doesn't get in the way.

04:51.980 --> 04:55.450
And then, we'll get Aki-chan to 
stop hanging out with Makabe.

04:55.450 --> 04:57.810
I'll be the one to make sure that happens.

04:59.110 --> 05:04.140
But knowing Koiwai Yoshino, 
she'll catch on if we take too long.

05:04.140 --> 05:09.000
I need you three to act first and make 
sure she doesn't get near Aki-chan.

05:15.890 --> 05:17.000
All right.

05:17.370 --> 05:21.380
I do feel bad for Aki-sama, 
but this is for her own good.

05:21.880 --> 05:23.880
Let's do this!

05:23.880 --> 05:26.160
Just you wait, Koiwai Yoshino!

05:25.820 --> 05:26.630
Yup, yup.

05:26.160 --> 05:28.350
Let's think up a sabotage plan.

05:28.350 --> 05:29.420
Let's do this!

05:29.420 --> 05:30.970
Yeah!

05:34.340 --> 05:37.560
<i>Still, there's no guarantee with this plan.</i>

05:37.560 --> 05:39.440
<i>We have to go to a place where we know for sure</i>

05:39.440 --> 05:41.940
<i>that neither Koiwai Yoshino 
nor Makabe will show up.</i>

05:49.090 --> 05:51.410
Aki-chan, would you like to go there?

05:51.410 --> 05:52.500
Huh?

05:54.070 --> 05:55.120
Sure.

05:55.120 --> 05:58.120
Well, no time like the present!

05:58.590 --> 05:59.930
Wait a sec.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.510
<b>Aki-sama
I'm going to head to the Ferris wheel</b>

06:10.850 --> 06:12.970
N-No way...

06:19.240 --> 06:20.100
But why?!

06:20.650 --> 06:22.560
The reason's simple.

06:23.520 --> 06:26.490
Because... It's because I...

06:27.220 --> 06:29.360
hated you so much, I could die.

06:36.780 --> 06:38.280
You've got chickenpox.

06:38.610 --> 06:42.460
It's highly contagious, so make sure 
you stay away from Aki-sama.

06:43.620 --> 06:45.340
You can't leave this room.

06:45.820 --> 06:47.550
How long?

06:47.550 --> 06:49.720
Until you're completely better.

06:50.360 --> 06:54.390
Make sure you tell Aki-sama 
to stay out of this room, too.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.340
Understood.

07:01.350 --> 07:03.940
It's fine if I can't see Aki-sama...

07:04.660 --> 07:06.100
I'm free.

07:06.900 --> 07:13.210
Back then, I was at constantly at the mercy 
of Aki-sama's endless bad moods.

07:20.790 --> 07:24.520
Mom, I can't go outside today, either?

07:24.520 --> 07:26.270
I don't have a fever anymore.

07:26.270 --> 07:27.690
Not yet.

07:27.690 --> 07:29.690
How many more days?

07:30.260 --> 07:32.520
We'll just have to wait and see.

07:36.710 --> 07:38.740
It's so quiet.

07:39.680 --> 07:42.410
<i>I don't even have anything to add to my diary.</i>

07:39.680 --> 07:43.150
<b>Kids' Study Notebook</b>

07:39.680 --> 07:43.150
<b>Picture Diary</b>

07:39.680 --> 07:43.150
<b>Kids' Study Guide</b>

07:43.150 --> 07:48.110
<b>Weather: Sunny
Handkerchief
Aki-sama made fun of the
handkerchief Mom made for me.
She said it looked poor
and that made it weird.</b>

07:43.150 --> 07:48.110
<b>Weather: Sunny
 Fireworks
Aki-sama suddenly said she
wanted to try an experiment
with skyrocket fireworks to see
if she could send someone
to the moon with them.
I was scared.
Fireworks are scary...</b>

07:43.530 --> 07:47.140
<i>I've only written stuff about Aki-sama, anyway.</i>

07:48.860 --> 07:53.070
<b>I ended up crying because Aki-sama
cut the hair off my favorite doll.
But my mom told me to just deal with it.</b>

07:54.350 --> 07:56.990
<i>Aki-sama might be bored, too,</i>

07:56.990 --> 07:59.540
<i>because she has no one to make her plaything.</i>

08:00.230 --> 08:03.500
<i>Is she mad? Is she sulking?</i>

08:04.690 --> 08:06.000
<i>Maybe she's even crying.</i>

08:06.700 --> 08:08.280
No, no, no!

08:08.280 --> 08:12.220
<i>Aki-sama's someone I have to take care of.</i>

08:13.330 --> 08:15.910
<i>Even if I'm not around...</i>

08:16.390 --> 08:19.180
Come on! Try harder, Masamune!

08:19.180 --> 08:20.760
Aki-sama?

08:24.510 --> 08:27.390
If you stop, Sean will catch up to you!

08:27.390 --> 08:29.480
I can't do this anymore!

08:29.950 --> 08:32.440
Then give up and get along with him.

08:33.640 --> 08:35.410
<i>A boy I don't know...</i>

08:35.770 --> 08:39.960
<i>I guess she can find a plaything to 
order around whenever she wants.</i>

08:40.370 --> 08:42.600
<i>But he's doomed.</i>

08:42.600 --> 08:45.840
<i>He's just going to get yelled 
at and bullied by Aki-sama.</i>

08:45.840 --> 08:47.020
<i>Poor thing.</i>

08:47.020 --> 08:48.120
Yay!

08:50.250 --> 08:52.060
Looks like we caught you, Masamune!

08:52.060 --> 08:55.550
Yeah, I guess you did.

09:02.230 --> 09:04.250
I think I was in shock.

09:04.800 --> 09:09.470
I thought I was the only one 
who could keep up with Aki-sama.

09:09.470 --> 09:12.900
And yet... he seemed so much happier than me.

09:13.990 --> 09:15.700
I could tell...

09:16.450 --> 09:18.090
that he...

09:19.020 --> 09:20.980
really liked Aki-sama.

09:26.740 --> 09:30.090
Did she get Yoshino's 
chickenpox after this long?

09:30.520 --> 09:33.800
Well, she has been playing 
outside quite often lately.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.550
Maybe she caught some unknown bug.

09:37.400 --> 09:41.460
Yoshino, keep an eye on Aki-sama.

09:45.200 --> 09:47.760
Are you okay, Aki-sama?

09:47.760 --> 09:50.390
Is this your fault, Yoshino?

09:51.120 --> 09:52.980
I don't know.

09:53.420 --> 09:57.360
This is awful. I hate being in this room.

09:58.130 --> 10:01.180
Too many of Mom and Dad's things are in here.

10:02.250 --> 10:04.700
You can't even take care of your own daughter?!

10:05.600 --> 10:07.390
I can say the same exact thing about you!

10:07.390 --> 10:10.510
Sir, Madam, Aki-sama is trying to rest...

10:10.510 --> 10:11.920
You're the one who was by her side!

10:11.920 --> 10:13.620
Would you shut up already?!

10:15.860 --> 10:21.050
They said "divorce" means that my mom 
and dad won't be married anymore.

10:21.450 --> 10:25.260
Mom's going to leave me...

10:25.260 --> 10:27.950
She says she can't help it 
because of a trial or something...

10:28.760 --> 10:31.360
<i>Is Aki-sama... crying?</i>

10:32.440 --> 10:37.820
But I'm not alone anymore.

10:38.140 --> 10:40.200
Because I have Masamune.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.610
I'll be okay.

10:47.270 --> 10:49.660
<i>Hey, Aki-sama...</i>

10:50.120 --> 10:51.460
<i>What about me?</i>

10:52.180 --> 10:56.420
I'd worked so hard...

10:56.920 --> 11:01.890
I'd done everything she told me 
to do ever since I was born.

11:02.460 --> 11:06.810
Because... that's what I was told to do.

11:09.750 --> 11:11.080
And yet...

11:12.350 --> 11:14.980
Aki-chan!

11:15.360 --> 11:16.580
That voice...

11:19.150 --> 11:22.360
Aki-chan! Aki-chan!

11:22.360 --> 11:25.020
Aki-chan!

11:26.080 --> 11:30.200
This loser's trying to get that 
boss girl to save him again?

11:30.200 --> 11:31.830
Talk about pathetic!

12:10.470 --> 12:11.830
Aki-chan...

12:12.680 --> 12:14.040
Aki-chan!

12:14.480 --> 12:16.130
Aki-chan!

12:16.130 --> 12:18.860
Aki-chan!

12:18.860 --> 12:22.350
Aki-chan! Aki-chan!

12:22.350 --> 12:25.670
Aki-chan!

12:27.650 --> 12:33.480
After that, you stopped coming around, 
and it was a huge weight off my shoulders.

12:35.010 --> 12:38.190
<i>He's white as a sheet. I guess I can't blame him.</i>

12:40.150 --> 12:45.110
<i>Everything he thought he knew is 
being destroyed down to its core.</i>

12:48.720 --> 12:51.660
But it wasn't good for Aki-sama.

12:52.660 --> 12:54.710
She fell apart.

12:55.260 --> 12:59.210
She cried every day and ended up hating boys.

13:01.830 --> 13:04.670
I regretted my actions 
for the first time in my life.

13:05.280 --> 13:09.140
I realized that I did something 
I never should have done.

13:09.760 --> 13:13.880
I looked for that boy for a really long time, 
but I could never find him.

13:15.700 --> 13:19.190
When I thought there was nothing 
I could do to make up for it...

13:19.190 --> 13:20.760
Wait, where?

13:20.340 --> 13:23.860
Hey, look! He's apparently a transfer student!

13:20.760 --> 13:22.590
Go talk to him!

13:23.860 --> 13:26.920
Makabe Masamune-kun is so cool!

13:28.720 --> 13:29.830
<i>Masamune...</i>

13:30.370 --> 13:32.790
There you were.

13:35.880 --> 13:39.430
I knew right away that it was you, Pig's Foot.

13:40.430 --> 13:43.520
You recognized me right away?

13:43.520 --> 13:46.050
Even though Adagaki Aki couldn't?

13:46.520 --> 13:50.010
Aki-sama's a bit dense. 
Please forgive her for that.

13:50.640 --> 13:54.300
That's just how powerful 
your old image is in her mind.

13:54.300 --> 13:54.980
And...

13:55.630 --> 13:59.820
I ended up helping you out 
because you remembered Aki-sama.

14:00.400 --> 14:03.690
I figured it could be the way 
to make it up to Aki-sama.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.800
Hey, wait a minute! 
How is that making it up to her?

14:06.800 --> 14:09.200
I'm trying to get revenge here!

14:09.200 --> 14:12.270
I was going to make her fall for 
me just so I could dump her!

14:14.480 --> 14:16.370
Even you said...

14:16.940 --> 14:19.610
If you dump her, and that makes 
her a little more modest,

14:19.610 --> 14:22.220
it greatly benefits me,

14:22.220 --> 14:23.340
as well as Aki-sama.

14:27.090 --> 14:28.170
I'm sorry.

14:28.960 --> 14:31.680
I didn't actually want you to dump her.

14:32.520 --> 14:33.680
Because...

14:34.680 --> 14:37.850
you can't hate Aki-sama when you've seen her

14:37.850 --> 14:40.150
for who she truly is, right?

14:47.030 --> 14:48.250
I...

14:52.790 --> 14:54.950
Right now, Aki-sama is...

14:55.830 --> 14:59.000
on a date with Kanetsugu.

15:00.080 --> 15:02.500
She still thinks he's Pig's Foot.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.460
I can't make any moves

15:07.460 --> 15:11.720
because my parents and some other 
people are keeping their eye on me.

15:12.760 --> 15:15.460
So, Pig's Foot...

15:17.300 --> 15:19.080
I need you to save Aki-sama.

15:22.940 --> 15:28.090
Damn it!

15:34.340 --> 15:38.230
Yes, go, Pig's Foot...

15:40.870 --> 15:42.740
To Aki-sama.

15:50.390 --> 15:52.380
<i>I'm an idiot.</i>

15:52.920 --> 15:55.050
<i>Master is also an idiot!</i>

15:57.100 --> 16:01.730
Everyone is a big, huge idiot!

16:06.690 --> 16:09.420
<i>Okay, we got this far.</i>

16:09.420 --> 16:12.960
<i>Now, how do I take the first step?</i>

16:12.960 --> 16:14.170
What's wrong?

16:15.000 --> 16:19.930
Huh? Er, I was just thinking how I finally 
got to be alone with you, Aki-chan.

16:20.790 --> 16:22.340
Right...

16:24.520 --> 16:27.460
Ugh, what is Yoshino doing?

16:29.360 --> 16:30.800
<i>Sorry, Aki-chan.</i>

16:31.380 --> 16:37.960
<i>But I need to get guaranteed additional 
funds from your family, no matter what.</i>

16:39.000 --> 16:43.120
<i>But considering I was already getting funding,</i>

16:43.120 --> 16:45.480
<i>I knew it would've proved 
difficult if I asked for more.</i>

16:46.260 --> 16:50.900
<i>That's why I need you to 
personally ask your family.</i>

16:51.440 --> 16:52.970
<i>That would mean</i>

16:52.970 --> 16:57.000
<i>you'd have to accept the Adagaki and Gasou 
families being connected by marriage.</i>

16:57.520 --> 16:59.910
<i>But I'm very aware...</i>

17:00.980 --> 17:05.370
<i>that the shadow of a certain man 
continues to live in your heart.</i>

17:06.050 --> 17:09.190
<i>And I need to make that shadow 
disappear here and now,</i>

17:10.450 --> 17:13.090
<i>in order to protect my own happiness.</i>

17:19.730 --> 17:21.140
Makabe?!

17:21.830 --> 17:23.100
You three...

17:23.590 --> 17:26.920
Wh-What the heck is he doing here?!

17:26.920 --> 17:32.000
I-I have no idea! 
But we have to stop him, too!

17:32.000 --> 17:37.610
But what if Koiwai Yoshino gets 
to Aki-sama in the meantime?

17:37.610 --> 17:38.820
Perfect timing!

17:39.460 --> 17:42.700
Do you know where 
Kanetsugu and Adagaki Aki are?

17:42.700 --> 17:46.040
Like we'd ever tell you, you cheater!

17:46.550 --> 17:48.250
Cheater?

17:48.250 --> 17:53.460
We are aware that you have been having 
secret rendezvous with Koiwai Yoshino.

17:55.440 --> 17:59.140
So what exactly are you planning 
to tell Aki-sama right now?

18:03.480 --> 18:05.960
See? You're speechless!

18:05.960 --> 18:08.030
Now stay away from Aki-sama!

18:08.030 --> 18:08.900
Shut up!

18:08.900 --> 18:11.610
Wh-What did you just say?!

18:12.240 --> 18:15.450
I have no intention of clearing up 
these little misunderstandings.

18:15.960 --> 18:19.070
If you're going to call me trash, 
that's fine, because it's true.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.920
But...

18:24.150 --> 18:28.540
Who's going to save Adagaki Aki 
from Gasou Kanetsugu's lies?

18:29.370 --> 18:31.420
Gasou Kanetsugu's...

18:31.850 --> 18:32.940
...lies?

18:36.480 --> 18:38.540
If you really care about Aki-sama, answer me.

18:39.030 --> 18:41.670
Where are those two right now?

18:46.330 --> 18:50.080
So what exactly are you planning 
to tell Aki-sama right now?

18:50.810 --> 18:55.440
<i>What am I planning to tell Adagaki Aki?</i>

18:58.400 --> 18:59.520
This is good, too.

18:58.400 --> 19:01.870
<b>Fresh Ice Cream</b>

18:58.970 --> 19:00.520
Want to take a little break?

18:59.520 --> 19:00.940
Really? Let me try some.

19:00.940 --> 19:02.830
I want to go on the roller coaster.

19:06.760 --> 19:08.060
Let's go!

19:09.230 --> 19:10.600
I wonder if I'm tall enough.

19:14.500 --> 19:16.700
You dropped it?

19:16.700 --> 19:18.460
Oh, jeez...

19:19.250 --> 19:20.280
Here.

19:23.980 --> 19:26.640
Thanks, Onii-chan.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.590
Don't drop it again, okay?

19:28.590 --> 19:29.580
'Kay.

19:30.770 --> 19:32.480
Here you go, Aki-chan.

19:33.910 --> 19:35.440
Thanks.

19:39.310 --> 19:41.000
You finally smiled.

19:41.000 --> 19:44.160
Did I seem that unfriendly?

19:44.160 --> 19:46.870
No, I wouldn't say so.

19:47.290 --> 19:50.540
But you've been trying to 
act tough for a while.

19:50.540 --> 19:53.250
If this is helping you relax, I'm glad.

19:53.520 --> 19:58.650
You're really good at calming people 
down, or making them a bit kinder.

19:58.650 --> 20:01.760
Really? Maybe it's because 
I have a little sister.

20:03.110 --> 20:06.470
Your little sister's still in the hospital, right?

20:06.950 --> 20:07.820
Yes.

20:08.640 --> 20:10.850
Is there anything I can do to help?

20:11.440 --> 20:16.030
I'd feel bad for asking. I'm already 
causing you enough trouble...

20:16.030 --> 20:18.360
And I wouldn't be able to return the favor.

20:18.670 --> 20:25.320
That's not true, Kane— 
Masamune. You came back to me.

20:26.120 --> 20:28.280
Of course I'd help you!

20:33.860 --> 20:38.210
So, really... Ask me for anything.

20:44.600 --> 20:46.840
Um, Aki-chan...

20:49.640 --> 20:50.390
Actually—

20:53.240 --> 20:54.310
Makabe?!

20:57.520 --> 21:00.400
Quit using my damn name!

21:11.080 --> 21:15.800
Please... reach Aki-sama in time.

21:18.150 --> 21:20.670
<i>Please let these feelings 
that started with hatred</i>

21:22.200 --> 21:24.140
<i>be something I can let go of here and now.</i>

21:28.970 --> 21:31.500
Wait, Makabe! What are you doing?!

21:31.500 --> 21:33.430
Then there's you!

21:33.710 --> 21:36.140
Even if this is all just a 
giant misunderstanding,

21:36.140 --> 21:40.310
I can't let your current ugly 
personality off the hook!

21:40.800 --> 21:42.070
<i>Ug—</i>

21:42.540 --> 21:44.030
So really...

21:44.900 --> 21:46.990
If you're gonna go out with someone like him...

21:51.270 --> 21:52.870
Go out with the real...

21:53.480 --> 21:54.940
Go out with me instead!
